  "synopsis": {
    "zh": "沈氏在家庭中長期聽婆婆誦《法華經》，病時願他世諸佛會中相見。原書續記坐逝與舍利，未指定西方。",
    "en": "Lady Shen listened steadily to her mother-in-law’s recitation. Her wish to meet in an assembly of the Buddhas does not name the Western Pure Land; the source continues with accounts of seated death and relics."
  },
  "witnesses": [
    {
      "work": "X1540",
